00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:58.960
I've never been to a place
like this before! It's awesome!

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:01.790
Put those lactic acid bacteria away
or they'll be spotted.

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:06.000
It looks like they're scooping something up
with a huge net. What is that?

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:10.790
There are nutrients that got dissolved
in the stomach on the other side of this wall.

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:13.580
It's here in the small intestine that
they get absorbed into the body,

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:14.540
processed and turned into
nutrients for you cells.

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.880
