00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:27.250
But if they're from outside, doesn't that mean
all kinds of substances get in? Like viruses?

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:30.460
Bad stuff like that isn't
absorbed by mistake, right?

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:33.540
Most of it gets destroyed by
gastric acid, so it's all good.

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:36.540
Still, there are other things,
too, that can get tricky.

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.960
Whoa! What's all this?

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:43.880
What are we going to do with all this?
Did you have to absorb this boatload of purines?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:49.330
B-But, sir, we have no recourse
against the mass production of purines.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.750
Don't make excuses!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.670
Listen, you know that uric acid is formed
when the body breaks down purines!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:54.750
--And if there's an excess buildup of uric acid,
sharp crystals will form,

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.330
--Oh man, he's getting yelled out. Poor guy...
