00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.790
--Oh man, he's getting yelled out. Poor guy...
--and that would mean major trouble!

00:17:58.790 --> 00:17:59.670
Yeah.

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:04.210
I'm telling you, it's like every other word
out of your mouth is some excuse!

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:05.920
That's why you're no good!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.040
Nyuuu...

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.330
Nyuuu!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:08.880
"TASTY LACTOSE"

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.420
"TASTY LACTOSE"
--Nyuuu! Nyuuu!
--Hey! Hey you, get back here!

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:14.460
--Nyuuu!
--Huh? Wh-What's that thing?

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:17.540
Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:21.080
--Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!
