00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.670
Nyuuu?

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:39.960
Nyuuu!

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:46.120
Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:47.210
"OM NOM NOM"
Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:50.670
"OM NOM NOM"
Wait! Huh? All they're doing
is devouring the purines?

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:52.710
"OM NOM NOM"
These guys are pretty docile, huh?

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:53.620
These guys are pretty docile, huh?

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:55.670
Hey, you're doing us a favor!

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:57.500
